      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00049",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "库蚊叮了我的脚。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A house mosquito bit my foot.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00049",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "鸡鸣四起。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Roosters began crowing on all sides.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00049",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我迎亮着了看路上，远处立着一个朦胧的白影。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As I looked down the road in the growing light, a hazy white figure stood in the distance.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00049",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "疑是拂晓的曙光，却原来是有为子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I thought it might be the dawn light, but it turned out to be Uiko.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
